  "description": "PDFsharp is the Open Source library for creating and modifying PDF documents using .NET. It has an easy-to-use API that allows developers to generate or modify PDF files programmatically. PDFsharp can be used for various applications, including creating reports, invoices, and other types of documents.\nThis package relies on Windows Forms (GDI+) and can be used under Windows only.\nSee https://docs.pdfsharp.net for details.",
